OL,3,ARAF Fairford incident involves 'foreign
OL,4,Aactor', says Rubio, as some evacuated
OL,5,Aresidents return home
OL,6,
OL,7,FA large cordon remains in place near
OL,8,Fthe base, with 85 households being told
OL,9,Fthey can return home after an
OL,10,Fevacuation on Sunday
OL,12,FOne local tells the BBC those who've
OL,13,Fgone home are being told to stay inside
OL,14,Fand not to take photos. "I want to wait
OL,15,Funtil I know more... it feels super
OL,16,Fdodge to me," she says
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
